# Conventional commits

Every git commit message in this repo uses [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/). See `docs/agents/conventional-commits.md`.

```
type(scope): description
```

Examples: `feat(link-hub): extract ascii portrait`, `docs: add clean-code agent guide`, `chore: add commitlint on pre-push`.
